             899     4   p    v                    cc(mm,jj) = cc(mm,jj) + poly(ml,j)*s(ml,1,k) - poly(mk,j)*s(mk,1,k)
             900     4   p    v                    cc(mp,j ) = cc(mp,j ) + poly(ml,j)*s(ml,2,k) + poly(mk,j)*s(mk,2,k)
